<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>My Website</title>
<style>
body{font-family:Arial;margin:0;background:#f5f5f5}
.header{background:#111;color:white;padding:40px;text-align:center}
.header h1{margin:0;font-size:40px}
.header p{opacity:0.7}
.box{background:white;margin:20px;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)}
.btn{background:#111;color:white;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;margin-top:10px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header">
<h1>Welcome to My Website</h1>
<p>danish560700-boop</p>
</div>

<div class="box">
<h2>About Me</h2>
<p>Ye meri pehli website hai jo maine GitHub pe banayi hai.</p>
<a class="btn" href="#">Contact Me</a>
</div>

<div class="box">
<h2>My Services</h2>
<p>✔️ Web Design<br>✔️ Development<br>✔️ Support</p>
</div>

</body>
</html>
